<tr style="height:1px;text-align:center"><td style="border-right:1px dotted;height:1em;width:1em"></td><td style="height:1em;border-bottom:1px dotted;width:1em"></td><td colspan="6" rowspan="2" style="border:2px solid;padding:0.2em">Developer</td><td colspan="6" rowspan="2" style="border:2px solid;padding:0.2em;border: 0; text-align: right;">propose↑</td><td rowspan="2" style="border-right:1px dotted;height:2em;width:1em"></td><td rowspan="2" style="height:2em;width:1em"></td></tr><tr style="height:1px;text-align:center"><td colspan="2" style="height:1em;width:2em"></td></tr>
<tr style="height:1px;text-align:center"><td colspan="2" rowspan="2" style="height:2em;width:2em"></td><td colspan="2" rowspan="2" style="height:2em;width:2em"></td><td style="border-right:1px dotted;height:1em;width:1em"></td><td style="height:1em;border-bottom:1px dotted;width:1em"></td><td colspan="2" style="height:1em;border-bottom:1px dotted;width:2em"></td><td colspan="2" style="height:1em;border-bottom:1px dotted;width:2em"></td><td colspan="2" style="height:1em;border-bottom:1px dotted;width:2em"></td><td colspan="2" style="height:1em;border-bottom:1px dotted;width:2em"></td><td style="border-right:1px dotted;border-bottom:1px dotted;height:1em;width:1em"></td><td rowspan="2" style="height:2em;width:1em"></td></tr><tr style="height:1px;text-align:center"><td colspan="2" style="height:1em;width:2em"></td><td colspan="2" style="height:1em;width:2em"></td><td colspan="2" style="height:1em;width:2em"></td><td colspan="2" style="height:1em;width:2em"></td><td colspan="2" style="height:1em;width:2em"></td><td style="height:1em;width:1em"></td></tr>
</tbody></table> </div><div class="thumbcaption">Simplified organizational structure</div></div></div>
<p id="mwBVs">Debian's policies and team efforts focus on <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Collaborative_software_development_model" title="Collaborative software development model" class="mw-redirect" id="mwBVw">collaborative software development and testing processes</a>.<sup about="#mwt640" class="mw-ref reference" id="cite_ref-144" rel="dc:references" typeof="mw:Extension/ref" data-mw="{&quot;name&quot;:&quot;ref&quot;,&quot;attrs&quot;:{},&quot;body&quot;:{&quot;id&quot;:&quot;mw-reference-text-cite_note-144&quot;}}"><a href="#cite_note-144" id="mwBV0"><span class="mw-reflink-text" id="mwBV4"><span class="cite-bracket" id="mwBV8">[</span>144<span class="cite-bracket" id="mwBWA">]</span></span></a></sup> As a result, a new major release tends to occur every two years with revision releases that fix security issues and important problems.<sup about="#mwt635" class="mw-ref reference" id="cite_ref-FOOTNOTEHertzog2013Section_1.6_117-1" rel="dc:references" typeof="mw:Transclusion mw:Extension/ref" data-mw="{&quot;name&quot;:&quot;ref&quot;,&quot;attrs&quot;:{&quot;group&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;name&quot;:&quot;FOOTNOTEHertzog2013Section 1.6&quot;},&quot;body&quot;:{&quot;id&quot;:&quot;mw-reference-text-cite_note-FOOTNOTEHertzog2013Section_1.6-117&quot;},&quot;parts&quot;:[{&quot;template&quot;:{&quot;target&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;sfn&quot;,&quot;href&quot;:&quot;./Template:Sfn&quot;},&quot;params&quot;:{&quot;1&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;Hertzog&quot;},&quot;2&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;2013&quot;},&quot;loc&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;Section 1.6&quot;}},&quot;i&quot;:0}}]}"><a href="#cite_note-FOOTNOTEHertzog2013Section_1.6-117" id="mwBWE"><span class="mw-reflink-text" id="mwBWI"><span class="cite-bracket" id="mwBWM">[</span>117<span class="cite-bracket" id="mwBWQ">]</span></span></a></sup><sup about="#mwt641" class="mw-ref reference" id="cite_ref-two-year-cycle_66-1" rel="dc:references" typeof="mw:Extension/ref" data-mw="{&quot;name&quot;:&quot;ref&quot;,&quot;attrs&quot;:{&quot;name&quot;:&quot;two-year-cycle&quot;}}"><a href="#cite_note-two-year-cycle-66" id="mwBWU"><span class="mw-reflink-text" id="mwBWY"><span class="cite-bracket" id="mwBWc">[</span>66<span class="cite-bracket" id="mwBWg">]</span></span></a></sup> The Debian project is a volunteer organization with two foundation documents:</p>
<ul id="mwBWk"><li id="mwBWo">The <i id="mwBWs"><a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Debian_Social_Contract" title="Debian Social Contract" id="mwBWw">Debian Social Contract</a></i> defines a set of basic principles by which the project and its developers conduct affairs.</li>
<li id="mwBW0">The <i id="mwBW4"><a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Debian_Free_Software_Guidelines" title="Debian Free Software Guidelines" class="mw-redirect" id="mwBW8">Debian Free Software Guidelines</a></i> define the criteria for "free software" and thus what software is permissible in the distribution. These guidelines have been adopted as the basis of <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/The_Open_Source_Definition" title="The Open Source Definition" id="mwBXA">The Open Source Definition</a>. Although this document can be considered separate, it formally is part of the Social Contract.<sup about="#mwt642" class="mw-ref reference" id="cite_ref-social-contract_16-1" rel="dc:references" typeof="mw:Extension/ref" data-mw="{&quot;name&quot;:&quot;ref&quot;,&quot;attrs&quot;:{&quot;name&quot;:&quot;social-contract&quot;}}"><a href="#cite_note-social-contract-16" id="mwBXE"><span class="mw-reflink-text" id="mwBXI"><span class="cite-bracket" id="mwBXM">[</span>16<span class="cite-bracket" id="mwBXQ">]</span></span></a></sup></li>
<li id="mwBXU">The <i id="mwBXY">Debian Constitution</i> describes the organizational structure for formal decision-making within the project, and enumerates the powers and responsibilities of the Project Leader, the Secretary and other roles.<sup about="#mwt643" class="mw-ref reference" id="cite_ref-constitution_18-1" rel="dc:references" typeof="mw:Extension/ref" data-mw="{&quot;name&quot;:&quot;ref&quot;,&quot;attrs&quot;:{&quot;name&quot;:&quot;constitution&quot;}}"><a href="#cite_note-constitution-18" id="mwBXc"><span class="mw-reflink-text" id="mwBXg"><span class="cite-bracket" id="mwBXk">[</span>18<span class="cite-bracket" id="mwBXo">]</span></span></a></sup></li></ul>

<span class="mw-empty-elt" about="#mwt644" typeof="mw:Transclusion" id="mwBXs" data-mw="{&quot;parts&quot;:[{&quot;template&quot;:{&quot;target&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;Historical populations\n&quot;,&quot;href&quot;:&quot;./Template:Historical_populations&quot;},&quot;params&quot;:{&quot;title&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;Debian developer population&quot;},&quot;1&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;[//www.debian.org/vote/1999/vote_0001#quorum 1999] &quot;},&quot;pop_name&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;{{abbr|DD|Debian developers}}&quot;},&quot;2&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;347\n&quot;},&quot;source&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;[//www.debian.org/vote/ Debian Voting Information]&quot;},&quot;3&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;[//www.debian.org/vote/2000/vote_0007#quorum 2000] &quot;},&quot;4&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;347\n&quot;},&quot;5&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;[//www.debian.org/vote/2001/vote_0001#quorum 2001] &quot;},&quot;6&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;?\n&quot;},&quot;7&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;[//www.debian.org/vote/2002/vote_0001#quorum 2002] &quot;},&quot;8&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;939\n&quot;},&quot;9&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;[//www.debian.org/vote/2003/vote_0001#quorum 2003] &quot;},&quot;10&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;831\n&quot;},&quot;11&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;[//www.debian.org/vote/2004/vote_001.quorum.log 2004] &quot;},&quot;12&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;911\n&quot;},&quot;13&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;[//www.debian.org/vote/2005/vote_001.quorum.log 2005] &quot;},&quot;14&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;965\n&quot;},&quot;15&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;[//www.debian.org/vote/2006/vote_001_quorum.log 2006] &quot;},&quot;16&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;972\n&quot;},&quot;17&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;[//www.debian.org/vote/2007/vote_001_quorum.log 2007] &quot;},&quot;18&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;1036\n&quot;},&quot;19&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;[//www.debian.org/vote/2008/vote_001_quorum.log 2008] &quot;},&quot;20&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;1075\n&