<li about="#cite_note-26" id="cite_note-26" data-mw-footnote-number="26"><span class="mw-cite-backlink" id="mwCSU"><a href="#cite_ref-26" rel="mw:referencedBy" id="mwCSY" aria-label="Jump up" title="Jump up"><span class="mw-linkback-text" id="mwCSc">↑</span></a></span> <span id="mw-reference-text-cite_note-26" class="mw-reference-text reference-text"><link rel="mw-deduplicated-inline-style" href="mw-data:TemplateStyles:r1333433106" about="#mwt110" typeof="mw:Extension/templatestyles mw:Transclusion" id="mwCSg" data-mw="{&quot;name&quot;:&quot;templatestyles&quot;,&quot;attrs&quot;:{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;Module:Citation/CS1/styles.css&quot;},&quot;body&quot;:{&quot;extsrc&quot;:&quot;&quot;},&quot;parts&quot;:[{&quot;template&quot;:{&quot;target&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;cite web&quot;,&quot;href&quot;:&quot;./Template:Cite_web&quot;},&quot;params&quot;:{&quot;last&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;Edge&quot;},&quot;first&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;Jake&quot;},&quot;date&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;2019-07-03&quot;},&quot;title&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;Debian and code names&quot;},&quot;url&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;https://lwn.net/Articles/792646/&quot;},&quot;website&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;LWN.net&quot;},&quot;access-date&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;2026-05-22&quot;}},&quot;i&quot;:0}}]}"><cite id="CITEREFEdge2019" class="citation web cs1" about="#mwt110">Edge, Jake (July 3, 2019). <a rel="mw:ExtLink nofollow" href="https://lwn.net/Articles/792646/" class="external text" id="mwCSk">"Debian and code names"</a>. <i id="mwCSo">LWN.net</i><span class="reference-accessdate" id="mwCSs">. Retrieved <span class="nowrap" id="mwCSw">May 22,</span> 2026</span>.</cite><span title="ctx_ver=Z39.88-2004&amp;rft_val_fmt=info%3Aofi%2Ffmt%3Akev%3Amtx%3Ajournal&amp;rft.genre=unknown&amp;rft.jtitle=LWN.net&amp;rft.atitle=Debian+and+code+names&amp;rft.date=2019-07-03&amp;rft.aulast=Edge&amp;rft.aufirst=Jake&amp;rft_id=https%3A%2F%2Flwn.net%2FArticles%2F792646%2F&amp;rfr_id=info%3Asid%2Fen.wikipedia.org%3ADebian" class="Z3988" about="#mwt110" id="mwCS0"></span></span></li>
<li about="#cite_note-27" id="cite_note-27" data-mw-footnote-number="27"><span class="mw-cite-backlink" id="mwCS4"><a href="#cite_ref-27" rel="mw:referencedBy" id="mwCS8" aria-label="Jump up" title="Jump up"><span class="mw-linkback-text" id="mwCTA">↑</span></a></span> <span id="mw-reference-text-cite_note-27" class="mw-reference-text reference-text"><link rel="mw-deduplicated-inline-style" href="mw-data:TemplateStyles:r1333433106" about="#mwt113" typeof="mw:Extension/templatestyles mw:Transclusion" id="mwCTE" data-mw="{&quot;name&quot;:&quot;templatestyles&quot;,&quot;attrs&quot;:{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;Module:Citation/CS1/styles.css&quot;},&quot;body&quot;:{&quot;extsrc&quot;:&quot;&quot;},&quot;parts&quot;:[{&quot;template&quot;:{&quot;target&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;cite web&quot;,&quot;href&quot;:&quot;./Template:Cite_web&quot;},&quot;params&quot;:{&quot;title&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;6.2.2. Where do these codenames come from?&quot;},&quot;url&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;https://www.debian.org/doc/manuals/debian-faq/ftparchives.en.html#sourceforcodenames&quot;},&quot;website&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;Debian Documentation&quot;},&quot;access-date&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;2026-05-22&quot;}},&quot;i&quot;:0}}]}"><cite class="citation web cs1" about="#mwt113" id="mwCTI"><a rel="mw:ExtLink nofollow" href="https://www.debian.org/doc/manuals/debian-faq/ftparchives.en.html#sourceforcodenames" class="external text" id="mwCTM">"6.2.2. Where do these codenames come from?"</a>. <i id="mwCTQ">Debian Documentation</i><span class="reference-accessdate" id="mwCTU">. Retrieved <span class="nowrap" id="mwCTY">May 22,</span> 2026</span>.</cite><span title="ctx_ver=Z39.88-2004&amp;rft_val_fmt=info%3Aofi%2Ffmt%3Akev%3Amtx%3Ajournal&amp;rft.genre=unknown&amp;rft.jtitle=Debian+Documentation&amp;rft.atitle=6.2.2.+Where+do+these+codenames+come+from%3F&amp;rft_id=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.debian.org%2Fdoc%2Fmanuals%2Fdebian-faq%2Fftparchives.en.html%23sourceforcodenames&amp;rfr_id=info%3Asid%2Fen.wikipedia.org%3ADebian" class="Z3988" about="#mwt113" id="mwCTc"></span></span></li>
<li about="#cite_note-28" id="cite_note-28" data-mw-footnote-number="28"><span class="mw-cite-backlink" id="mwCTg"><a href="#cite_ref-28" rel="mw:referencedBy" id="mwCTk" aria-label="Jump up" title="Jump up"><span class="mw-linkback-text" id="mwCTo">↑</span></a></span> <span id="mw-reference-text-cite_note-28" class="mw-reference-text reference-text"><link rel="mw-deduplicated-inline-style" href="mw-data:TemplateStyles:r1333433106" about="#mwt116" typeof="mw:Extension/templatestyles mw:Transclusion" id="mwCTs" data-mw="{&quot;name&quot;:&quot;templatestyles&quot;,&quot;attrs&quot;:{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;Module:Citation/CS1/styles.css&quot;},&quot;body&quot;:{&quot;extsrc&quot;:&quot;&quot;},&quot;parts&quot;:[{&quot;template&quot;:{&quot;target&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;cite usenet&quot;,&quot;href&quot;:&quot;./Template:Cite_usenet&quot;},&quot;params&quot;:{&quot;last&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;Murdoch&quot;},&quot;first&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;Ian&quot;},&quot;date&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;1993-08-16&quot;},&quot;title&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;New release under development; suggestions requested&quot;},&quot;url&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;https://groups.google.com/g/comp.os.linux.development/c/Md3Modzg5TU/m/xty88y5OLaMJ&quot;},&quot;quote&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;Fellow Linuxers,&lt;br&gt; This is just to announce the imminent completion of a brand-new Linux release, which I'm calling the Debian Linux Release. This is a release that I have put together basically from scratch; in other words, I didn't simply make some changes to SLS and call it a new release. I was inspired to put together this release after running SLS and generally being dissatisfied with much of it, and after much altering of SLS I decided that it would be easier to start from scratch.&quot;}},&quot;i&quot;:0}}]}"><cite id="CITEREFMurdoch1993" class="citation newsgroup cs1" about="#mwt116">Murdoch, Ian (August 16, 1993). <a rel="mw:ExtLink nofollow" href="https://groups.google.com/g/comp.os.linux.development/c/Md3Modzg5TU/m/xty88y5OLaMJ" class="external text" id="mwCTw">"New release under development; suggestions requested"</a>. <q id="mwCT0">Fellow Linuxers,<br id="mwCT4"> This is just to announce the imminent completion of a brand-new Linux release, which I'm calling the Debian Linux Release. This is a release that I have put together basically from scratch; in other words, I didn't simply make some changes to SLS and call it a new release. I was inspired to put together this release after running SLS and generally being dissatisfied with much of it, and after much altering of SLS I decided that it would be easier to start from scratch.</q></cite><span title="ctx_ver=Z39.88-2004&amp;rft_val_fmt=info%3Aofi%2Ffmt%3Akev%3Amtx%3Abook&amp;rft.genre=unknown&amp;rft.btitle=New+release+under+development%3B+suggestions+requested&amp;rft.date=1993-08-16&amp;rft.aulast=Murdoch&amp;rft.aufirst=Ian&amp;rft_id=https%3A%2F%2Fgroups.google.com%2Fg%2Fcomp.os.linux.development%2Fc%2FMd3Modzg5TU%2Fm%2Fxty88y5OLaMJ&amp;rfr_id=info%3Asid%2Fen.wikipedia.org%3ADebian" class="Z3988" about="#mwt116" id="mwCT8"></span></span></li>
<li about="#cite_note-29" id="cite_note-29" data-mw-footnote-number="29"><span class="mw-cite-backlink" id="mwCUA"><a href="#cite_ref-29" rel="mw:referencedBy" id="mwCUE" aria-label="Jump up" title="Jump up"><span class="mw-linkback-text" id="mwCUI">↑</span></a></span> <span id="mw-reference-text-cite_note-29" class="mw-reference-text reference-text"><link rel="mw-deduplicated-inline-style" href="mw-data:TemplateStyles:r1333433106" about="#mwt119" typeof="mw:Extension/templatestyles mw:Transclusion" id="mwCUM" data-mw="{&quot;name&quot;:&quot;templatestyles&quot;,&quot;attrs&quot;:{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;Module:Citation/CS1/styles.css&quot;},&quot;body&quot;:{&quot;extsrc&quot;:&quot;&quot;},&quot;parts&quot;:[{&quot;template&quot;:{&quot;target&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;cite usenet&quot;,&quot;href&quot;:&quot;./Template:Cite_usenet&quot;},&quot;params&quot;:{&quot;last&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;Murdoch&quot;},&quot;first&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;Ian&quot;},&quot;date&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;1993-08-16&quot;},&quot;title&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;New release under development; suggestions requested&quot;},&quot;url&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;https://groups.google.com/g/comp.os.linux.development/c/Md3Modzg5TU/m/xty88y5OLaMJ&quot;},&quot;quote&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;The base system is now virtually complete (though I'm still looking around to make sure that I grabbed the most recent sources for everything), and I'd like to get some feedback before I add the \&quot;fancy\&quot; stuff.&lt;br&gt; Please note that this release is not yet completed and may not be for several more weeks; however, I thought I'd post now to perhaps draw a few people out of the woodwork.&quot;}},&quot;i&quot;:0}}]}"><cite id="mwCUQ" class="citation newsgroup cs1" about="#mwt119" data-x-id="CITEREFMurdoch1993">Murdoch, Ian (August 16, 1993). <a rel="mw:ExtLink nofollow" href="https://groups.google.com/g/comp.os.linux.development/c/Md3Modzg5TU/m/xty88y5OLaMJ" class="external text" id="mwCUU">"New release under development; suggestions requested"</a>. <q id="mwCUY">The base system is now virtually complete (though I'm still looking around to make sure that I grabbed the most recent sources for everything), and I'd like to get some feedback before I add the "fancy" stuff.<br id="mwCUc"> Please note that this release is not yet completed and may not be for several more weeks; however, I thought I'd post now to perhaps draw a few people out of the woodwork.</q></cite><span title="ctx_ver=Z39.88-2004&amp;rft_val_fmt=info%3Aofi%2Ffmt%3Akev%3Amtx%3Abook&amp;rft.genre=unknown&amp;rft.btitle=New+release+under+development%3B+suggestions+requested&amp;rft.date=1993-08-16&amp;rft.aulast=Murdoch&amp;rft.aufirst=Ian&amp;rft_id=https%3A%2F%2Fgroups.google.com%2Fg%2Fcomp.os.linux.development%2Fc%2FMd3Modzg5TU%2Fm%2Fxty88y5OLaMJ&amp;rfr_id=info%3Asid%2Fen.wikipedia.org%3ADebian" class="Z3988" about="#mwt119" id="mwCUg"></span></span></li>
<li about="#cite_note-30" id="cite_note-30" data-mw-footnote-number="30"><span class="mw-cite-backlink" id="mwCUk"><a href="#cite_ref-30" rel="mw:referencedBy" id="mwCUo" aria-label="Jump up" title="Jump up"><span class="mw-linkback-text" id="mwCUs">↑</span></a></span> <span id="mw-reference-text-cite_note-30" class="mw-reference-text reference-text"><link rel="mw-deduplicated-inline-style" href="mw-data:TemplateStyles:r1333433106" about="#mwt122" typeof="mw:Extension/templatestyles mw:Transclusion" id="mwCUw" data-mw="{&quot;name&quot;:&quot;templatestyles&quot;,&quot;attrs&quot;:{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;Module:Citation/CS1/styles.css&quot;},&quot;body&quot;:{&quot;extsrc&quot;:&quot;&quot;},&quot;parts&quot;:[{&quot;template&quot;:{&quot;target&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;cite web&quot;,&quot;href&quot;:&quot;./Template:Cite_web&quot;},&quot;params&quot;:{&quot;last&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;Moody&quot;},&quot;first&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;Glyn&quot;},&quot;date&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;2016-01-06&quot;},&quot;title&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;The birth of Debian, in the words of Ian Murdock himself&quot;},&quot;url&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;https://arstechnica.com/information-technology/2016/01/the-birth-of-debian-in-the-words-of-ian-murdock-himself/&quot;},&quot;website&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;Ars Technica&quot;},&quot;access-date&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;2026-05-27&quot;}},&quot;i&quot;:0}}]}"><cite id="CITEREFMoody2016" class="citation web cs1" about="#mwt122">Moody, Glyn (January 6, 2016). <a rel="mw:ExtLink nofollow" href="https://arstechnica.com/information-technology/2016/01/the-birth-of-debian-in-the-words-of-ian-murdock-himself/" class="external text" id="mwCU0">"The birth of Debian, in the words of Ian Murdock himself"</a>. <i id="mwCU4">Ars Technica</i><span class="reference-accessdate" id="mwCU8">. Retrieved <span class="nowrap" id="mwCVA">May 27,</span> 2026</span>.</cite><span title="ctx_ver=Z39.88-2004&amp;rft_val_fmt=info%3Aofi%2Ffmt%3Akev%3Amtx%3Ajournal&amp;rft.genre=unknown&amp;rft.jtitle=Ars+Technica&amp;rft.atitle=The+birth+of+Debian%2C+in+the+words+of+Ian+Murdock+himself&amp;rft.date=2016-01-06&amp;rft.aulast=Moody&amp;rft.aufirst=Glyn&amp;rft_id=https%3A%2F%2Farstechnica.com%2Finformation-technology%2F2016%2F01%2Fthe-birth-of-debian-in-the-words-of-ian-murdock-himself%2F&amp;rfr_id=info%3Asid%2Fen.wikipedia.org%3ADebian" class="Z3988" about="#mwt122" id="mwCVE"></span></span></li>
<li about="#cite_note-31" id="cite_note-31" data-mw-footnote-number="31"><span class="mw-cite-backlink" id="mwCVI"><a href="#cite_ref-31" rel="mw:referencedBy" id="mwCVM" aria-label="Jump up" title="Jump up"><span class="mw-linkback-text" id="mwCVQ">↑</span></a></span> <span id="mw-reference-text-cite_note-31" class="mw-reference-text reference-text"><link rel="mw-deduplicated-inline-style" href="mw-data:TemplateStyles:r1333433106" about="#mwt125" typeof="mw:Extension/templatestyles mw:Transclusion" id="mwCVU" data-mw="{&quot;name&quot;:&quot;templatestyles&quot;,&quot;attrs&quot;:{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;Module:Citation/CS1/styles.css&quot;},&quot;body&quot;:{&quot;extsrc&quot;:&quot;&quot;},&quot;parts&quot;:[{&quot;template&quot;:{&quot;target&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;cite web&quot;,&quot;href&quot;:&quot;./Template:Cite_web&quot;},&quot;params&quot;:{&quot;last&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;Searls&quot;},&quot;first&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;Doc&quot;},&quot;date&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;2016-01-06&quot;},&quot;title&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;Ian Murdock: a tribute to the man and his work on Linux&quot;},&quot;url&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;https://www.theguardian.com/technology/2015/dec/31/ian-murdock-a-tribute-to-the-man-and-his-work-on-linux&quot;},&quot;website&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;The Guardian&quot;},&quot;access-date&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;2026-06-01&quot;}},&quot;i&quot;:0}}]}"><cite id="CITEREFSearls2016" class="citation web cs1" about="#mwt125">Searls, Doc (January 6, 2016). <a rel="mw:ExtLink nofollow" href="https://www.theguardian.com/technology/2015/dec/31/ian-murdock-a-tribute-to-the-man-and-his-work-on-linux" class="external text" id="mwCVY">"Ian Murdock: a tribute to the man and his work on Linux"</a>. <i id="mwCVc">The Guardian</i><span class="reference-accessdate" id="mwCVg">. Retrieved <span class="nowrap" id="mwCVk">June 1,</span> 2026</span>.</cite><span title="ctx_ver=Z39.88-2004&amp;rft_val_fmt=info%3Aofi%2Ffmt%3Akev%3Amt